```mdl
decision D-19: Expressive Code's Twoslash plugin compiles each sample at build time and renders its hover types. Fills in [D-4].
  date: 2026-11-04
  by: agent:claude-code
  for: user:richburdon
  affects: [F-3.2, F-3.4]
  why: One step then gives both the type check and the hover cards, and each sample keeps its context through a cut marker, so a page shows only its region.
  rejected:
    - Hand-written hover text: it goes stale the way the current ECHO docs have.
```

